``` KV-04 | Largest and Fastest-Growing KV Store Collections
    Splunk Administrator Field Manual - Gaurav Malik

    Use case: The KV Store data directory is growing, initial sync takes
    hours, or memory use on the search head keeps climbing; rank collections
    by size and by growth over the last week.
    Run on: SH, against the KV Store captain's _introspection (sizes are the
    same on every member once replicated).
    Query: Main query
    STATUS: lab verification pending; field or message names may differ on your version.
```
index=_introspection sourcetype=kvstore component=KVStoreCollectionStats
    earliest=-7d
| eval ns='data.ns', size_mb='data.size' / 1024 / 1024,
       storage_mb='data.storageSize' / 1024 / 1024,
       index_mb='data.totalIndexSize' / 1024 / 1024,
       docs='data.count'
| stats earliest(size_mb) as size_mb_7d_ago latest(size_mb) as size_mb
        latest(storage_mb) as storage_mb latest(index_mb) as index_mb
        latest(docs) as docs
        by host ns
| eval growth_mb=round(size_mb - size_mb_7d_ago, 1),
       size_mb=round(size_mb, 1), storage_mb=round(storage_mb, 1),
       index_mb=round(index_mb, 1)
| sort - size_mb
| head 25
| table host ns docs size_mb storage_mb index_mb growth_mb
